src/naptrap/models/network.py implements the PhonMatchNet architecture
(Yong-Hyeok Lee and Namhyun Cho, Interspeech 2023) after NCSOFT's
BSD-3-Clause PyTorch implementation, https://github.com/ncsoft/PhonMatchNet.
NCSOFT's copyright notice and license: licenses/PhonMatchNet-BSD-3-Clause.txt.
naptrap is not affiliated with or endorsed by NCSOFT or the PhonMatchNet authors.

src/naptrap/text.py reimplements the decoder-state "embedding" computation of
g2p_en by Kyubyong Park and Jongseok Kim (Apache-2.0),
https://github.com/Kyubyong/g2p.

src/naptrap/google.py reimplements Google's speech_embedding/1 model
(Apache-2.0) in PyTorch. naptrap is not affiliated with or endorsed by Google.

Model weights are not included in this package; see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
